**`src/services/contentstack.ts`** — Confirmed and finalised:
- Stack `options.live_preview` block uses `preview_token` (NOT `management_token`) — fixes review defect #1
- No `host` field inside the `live_preview` block — fixes review defect #3 (host goes through `Stack.setHost`)
