  - `preview_token` used (not `management_token`)
  - No `host` inside `live_preview`
  - `setHost` called with `CONTENTSTACK_PREVIEW_HOST` when set (priority)
  - Falls back to `CONTENTSTACK_API_HOST`
  - `setHost` not called when both are unset
  - `preview_hash` forwarded to `stack.livePreviewQuery` when set
